\newlabel{fig:component}{{4}{7}{C4 Component diagram (Level 3) of the firelab service. The four zones run in this order every tick: world, sensing, intelligence, actuation. Only readings leave the orange group, and the layering test fails if anything else does. The arrow into the orange group is the actuation zone writing sprinkler and door state into the world. The dotted arrow is the one call that leaves the process: the LLM adapter asking the model endpoint about a room, off the tick.\relax }{figure.caption.5}{}}
